{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-42995","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49011","text":"--- name: deliberate description: Use when retrieve returns routing \"deliberate\", when κ > 0 is detected, before high-stakes decisions with cyclic knowledge, or when the user asks to \"deliberate\", \"reason through cycles\", \"analyze topology\", \"think through this carefully\". For detecting contradictions use "},{"id":"spn-49012","marks":["code"],"text":"belief"},{"id":"spn-49013","text":"; this skill reasons through cyclic structures once detected. Routes through the "},{"id":"spn-49014","marks":["code"],"text":"route"},{"id":"spn-49015","text":" machine. argument-hint: <question or decision to deliberate on> ---"}]},{"id":"blk-42996","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-49016","text":"Topology and Deliberation"}]},{"id":"blk-42997","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49017","text":"Detect and reason through circular dependencies (cycles) in knowledge."}]},{"id":"blk-42998","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-49018","text":"Key Concepts"}]},{"id":"blk-42999","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49019","marks":["bold"],"text":"kappa"},{"id":"spn-49020","text":" is the cycle-complexity invariant — it measures how entangled the knowledge is:"}]},{"id":"blk-43000","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43002","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49021","marks":["bold"],"text":"kappa = 0"},{"id":"spn-49022","text":" — acyclic DAG, no cycles. Safe for fast retrieval."}]}],"id":"blk-43001","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43004","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49023","marks":["bold"],"text":"kappa = 1"},{"id":"spn-49024","text":" — simple cycle (A->B->C->A). Deliberation may help for high-stakes decisions."}]}],"id":"blk-43003","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43006","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49025","marks":["bold"],"text":"kappa = 2+"},{"id":"spn-49026","text":" — nested/overlapping cycles. Deliberation strongly recommended."}]}],"id":"blk-43005","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-43007","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49027","marks":["bold"],"text":"SCCs (Strongly Connected Components)"},{"id":"spn-49028","text":" are maximal cyclic clusters — groups of nodes where every node can reach every other node through directed edges."}]},{"id":"blk-43008","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49029","marks":["bold"],"text":"Fault-line edges"},{"id":"spn-49030","text":" are the weakest links in a cycle — the assumptions most likely to be wrong. Examining these first is the fastest path to resolving contradictions."}]},{"id":"blk-43009","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-49031","text":"Arguments"}]},{"id":"blk-43010","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49032","text":"Question to deliberate: $ARGUMENTS"}]},{"id":"blk-43011","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-49033","text":"Analyze Topology"}]},{"id":"blk-43012","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49034","text":"Read-only diagnostic — understand the structure:"}]},{"id":"blk-43013","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"route(action: \"topology\", query: \"<topic>\")"},{"id":"blk-43014","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49035","marks":["bold"],"text":"Parameters:"}]},{"id":"blk-43015","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43017","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49036","marks":["code"],"text":"node_ids"},{"id":"spn-49037","text":" (optional) — explicit array of node IDs to analyze"}]}],"id":"blk-43016","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43019","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49038","marks":["code"],"text":"query"},{"id":"spn-49039","text":" (optional) — retrieve nodes by query, then analyze"}]}],"id":"blk-43018","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43021","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49040","text":"Neither — analyzes full graph"}]}],"id":"blk-43020","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-43022","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49041","text":"If both "},{"id":"spn-49042","marks":["code"],"text":"node_ids"},{"id":"spn-49043","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-49044","marks":["code"],"text":"query"},{"id":"spn-49045","text":" are provided, "},{"id":"spn-49046","marks":["code"],"text":"node_ids"},{"id":"spn-49047","text":" takes precedence."}]},{"id":"blk-43023","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49048","marks":["bold"],"text":"Response fields:"}]},{"id":"blk-43024","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43026","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49049","marks":["code"],"text":"routing"},{"id":"spn-49050","text":" — "},{"id":"spn-49051","marks":["code"],"text":"\"fast\""},{"id":"spn-49052","text":" or "},{"id":"spn-49053","marks":["code"],"text":"\"deliberate\""}]}],"id":"blk-43025","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43028","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49054","marks":["code"],"text":"max_kappa"},{"id":"spn-49055","text":" — highest kappa value found"}]}],"id":"blk-43027","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43030","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49056","marks":["code"],"text":"sccs"},{"id":"spn-49057","text":" — array of strongly connected components, each with its own "},{"id":"spn-49058","marks":["code"],"text":"routing"},{"id":"spn-49059","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-49060","marks":["code"],"text":"kappa"}]}],"id":"blk-43029","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43032","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49061","marks":["code"],"text":"fault_line_edges"},{"id":"spn-49062","text":" — weakest edges in cycles (examine these first)"}]}],"id":"blk-43031","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43034","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49063","marks":["code"],"text":"deliberation_budget"},{"id":"spn-49064","text":" — "},{"id":"spn-49065","marks":["code"],"text":"max_iterations"},{"id":"spn-49066","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-49067","marks":["code"],"text":"focus_edges"},{"id":"spn-49068","text":" to guide deliberation effort"}]}],"id":"blk-43033","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43036","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49069","marks":["code"],"text":"recommendation"},{"id":"spn-49070","text":" — human-readable guidance"}]}],"id":"blk-43035","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43038","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49071","marks":["code"],"text":"selection"},{"id":"spn-49072","text":" — how nodes were resolved (explicit/query/full_graph)"}]}],"id":"blk-43037","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43040","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49073","marks":["code"],"text":"approximate"},{"id":"spn-49074","text":" — whether analysis used approximation for large graphs"}]}],"id":"blk-43039","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-43041","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-49075","text":"Deliberate Through Cycles"}]},{"id":"blk-43042","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49076","text":"Reason through cyclic knowledge and optionally persist conclusions:"}]},{"id":"blk-43043","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"route(action: \"deliberate\",\n  query: \"Should we use approach A or B given the conflicting evidence?\",\n  node_ids: [\"<node1>\", \"<node2>\"],\n  write_back: true\n)"},{"id":"blk-43044","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49077","marks":["bold"],"text":"Response fields:"}]},{"id":"blk-43045","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43047","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49078","marks":["code"],"text":"conclusions"},{"id":"spn-49079","text":" — array of resolved conclusions, each with "},{"id":"spn-49080","marks":["code"],"text":"source_scc_id"},{"id":"spn-49081","text":", "},{"id":"spn-49082","marks":["code"],"text":"source_kappa"},{"id":"spn-49083","text":", "},{"id":"spn-49084","marks":["code"],"text":"fault_lines_examined"}]}],"id":"blk-43046","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43049","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49085","marks":["code"],"text":"deliberation.converged"},{"id":"spn-49086","text":" — whether deliberation reached stable conclusions"}]}],"id":"blk-43048","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43051","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49087","marks":["code"],"text":"deliberation.iterations_used"},{"id":"spn-49088","text":" — how many reasoning passes were needed"}]}],"id":"blk-43050","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43053","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49089","marks":["code"],"text":"deliberation.topology_change"},{"id":"spn-49090","text":" — "},{"id":"spn-49091","marks":["code"],"text":"kappa_before"},{"id":"spn-49092","text":", "},{"id":"spn-49093","marks":["code"],"text":"kappa_after"},{"id":"spn-49094","text":", "},{"id":"spn-49095","marks":["code"],"text":"new_nodes_created"}]}],"id":"blk-43052","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-43054","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-49096","text":"When to use "},{"id":"spn-49097","marks":["code"],"text":"write_back"}]},{"id":"blk-43055","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43057","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49098","marks":["code"],"text":"write_back: true"},{"id":"spn-49099","text":" — crystallizes conclusions as new nodes. Use when you've reached a resolution you want to persist (reduces kappa for future retrievals)."}]}],"id":"blk-43056","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43059","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49100","marks":["code"],"text":"write_back: false"},{"id":"spn-49101","text":" — reasoning only, no graph changes. Use for exploration or when you're not confident in the conclusion yet."}]}],"id":"blk-43058","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-43060","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-49102","text":"Full Workflow"}]},{"id":"blk-43061","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49103","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-49104","marks":["bold"],"text":"Detect"},{"id":"spn-49105","text":" — "},{"id":"spn-49106","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieve(action: \"context\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-49107","text":" returns "},{"id":"spn-49108","marks":["code"],"text":"topology.routing: \"deliberate\""},{"id":"spn-49109","text":" 2. "},{"id":"spn-49110","marks":["bold"],"text":"Diagnose"},{"id":"spn-49111","text":" — "},{"id":"spn-49112","marks":["code"],"text":"route(action: \"topology\", query: \"...\")"},{"id":"spn-49113","text":" for detailed cycle info and fault-lines 3. "},{"id":"spn-49114","marks":["bold"],"text":"Examine fault-lines"},{"id":"spn-49115","text":" — inspect the weakest edges identified in step 2 4. "},{"id":"spn-49116","marks":["bold"],"text":"Deliberate"},{"id":"spn-49117","text":" — "},{"id":"spn-49118","marks":["code"],"text":"route(action: \"deliberate\", query: \"...\", write_back: true)"},{"id":"spn-49119","text":" to reason through and resolve 5. "},{"id":"spn-49120","marks":["bold"],"text":"Verify"},{"id":"spn-49121","text":" — re-run "},{"id":"spn-49122","marks":["code"],"text":"route(action: \"topology\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-49123","text":" to confirm kappa decreased after resolution"}]},{"id":"blk-43062","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-49124","text":"When NOT to deliberate"}]},{"id":"blk-43063","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43065","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49125","text":"When "},{"id":"spn-49126","marks":["code"],"text":"routing: \"fast\""},{"id":"spn-49127","text":" — normal retrieval is sufficient"}]}],"id":"blk-43064","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43067","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49128","text":"For low-stakes decisions — deliberation has a cost"}]}],"id":"blk-43066","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43069","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49129","text":"When there are no cycles (kappa = 0) — nothing to deliberate about"}]}],"id":"blk-43068","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43071","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49130","text":"Over-deliberation is an anti-pattern — only deliberate when routing recommends it or you suspect contradictions"}]}],"id":"blk-43070","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaiera4ez3vkjuptbyzrkvbyjxeir5cyvork2hku6gp2ko2wk35osir2sa","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}